;S HobbyNet is a small FTN echomail network set up by
;S Mike Dippel to support Sysops who want to provide
;S hobby-related topics for their users.
;S
;S
;S HobbyNet encourages the use of Vmodem (Netserial) on port 3141 as it
;S works seemless with PXW and Wildcat. There are detailed help files
;S to help you configure your system.
;S
;S If you operate a BBS system, then we invite you to join us
;S by filling in the application online at
;S http://hobbynet.hobbyline.com
;S
;S
;S Mike Dippel - HobbyNet Coordinator
;S mdippel@gmail.com
;S
;
